WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:06.740
"Whoever does not jump is Viktor Orban" they
chant,

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:12.070
Hungary's prime minister, a pariah here among
this coalition of opposition.

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:18.020
All day sunday, thousands - from the greens
to the far-right - were united in anger.

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:21.630
Fed up with what they say is their government's
creeping authoritarianism.

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:29.860
In the thick of the smoke bombs, tear gas
and clashes - desperate voices plead for calm.

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:33.270
"Do not throw!

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:34.270
Do not throw!

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:38.720
Why are you throwing?"

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:40.860
Others pointed the finger at the police.

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:44.350
"I want to say that these protesters are here
for you too.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:48.690
For you and you and you, for all of you."

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:52.810
The outrage was sparked by a rowdy parliamentary
session last week.

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:57.090
With Viktor Orban's government taking over
control of a judicial system that has until

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:59.190
now been independent.

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:04.820
and weakened employment rights - described
as a "slave law" by critics.

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:14.220
For many, this 7th constitutional change in
as many years under Orban was the last straw.

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:16.800
"Well, I'd like to have a democracy here.

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:21.040
I'd like to live in a country where I can
freely decide on what I can do and no decisions

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:22.290
are made above my head."

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:27.780
"We have unfortunately reached the point when
the government interferes with almost every

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:33.590
bit of people's everyday life; in cultural
administration, labour and healthcare."

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:39.310
The outcry is piling pressure on Hungary'
government.

00:01:39.310 --> 00:01:44.960
And puts its controversial leader on a collision
course, not just with the European Union,

00:01:44.960 --> 00:04:38.080
but with his own people.

